Why: tracing + data lineage is critical for multi-tenant privacy and debugging; tests basic telemetry thinking.

## Key Concepts

- OpenTelemetry, W3C trace context
- Data lineage, tenantId propagation
- PII redaction in logs and policy checks
- Cross-region privacy and data locality

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: propagate tenantId in trace context and redact logs
import { trace, context } from '@opentelemetry/api';
function logWithTenant(tenantId, msg) {
  const span = trace.getSpan(context.active());
  span.setAttribute('tenant.id', tenantId);
  const redacted = redactPII(msg);
  console.log(`${tenantId} ${redacted}`);
}
```

